Downstream gaps are independently real:

- translated rank-one chart open immersion;
- pointwise coverage for those charts;
- filtered-colimit compatibility and finite-stage spreading;
- non-affine finite-Galois descent effectivity;
- quasi-compactness needed for `JacobianData`;
- wiring or porting into the separate sibling package.

The sibling’s existing FGA representability route remains `sorryAx`-backed and cannot certify the requested endpoint. No files or Horizon state were modified.

